CS, ACS, and ANCS catalysts.</p></div></div></div><div id="fig6" content-id="fig6" class="fig fig-modal reveal-modal" data-reveal="data-reveal"><div class="fig-label fig-label">Figure 6</div><div class="graphic-wrap"><a class="fig-link" href="/view-large/figure/165496543/ao4c03987_0006.tif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-describedby="sr-fig-viewer-action"><img class="content-image js-graphic-position-float" src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0006.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=Qj7XFN7XcG3enPe4wcbjBjl78Y9gi60r95NJBs9L2TNo1WkfsdgsDwdGHDhQ4jrSJrwszyUAiumYr7D16zS~4BL3u02RyEWnrwg5YQtQ5HRsnxplTLfgUblVDTRijB1X9PDJBpU81adC~KW~9cUktI7mF~u3jOV244GJxtktC5FDPIy9vTKrlPjf-G1qPRN-I3Ul7YFzILSzBAfuS6MNhnzLoWJHs~3eHhJrJ--LNR2H1zRS31O~joMzwl60mn9bkfLcYR6~U08CRLgVDLKmbn2s5YGuyTH3689fAdEvvGHxxEO3T6kXOODYOUsCdKB8jplj7dAljG9Bw2whufirDw__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" data-src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0006.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=Qj7XFN7XcG3enPe4wcbjBjl78Y9gi60r95NJBs9L2TNo1WkfsdgsDwdGHDhQ4jrSJrwszyUAiumYr7D16zS~4BL3u02RyEWnrwg5YQtQ5HRsnxplTLfgUblVDTRijB1X9PDJBpU81adC~KW~9cUktI7mF~u3jOV244GJxtktC5FDPIy9vTKrlPjf-G1qPRN-I3Ul7YFzILSzBAfuS6MNhnzLoWJHs~3eHhJrJ--LNR2H1zRS31O~joMzwl60mn9bkfLcYR6~U08CRLgVDLKmbn2s5YGuyTH3689fAdEvvGHxxEO3T6kXOODYOUsCdKB8jplj7dAljG9Bw2whufirDw__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" alt="Figure 6. Refer to the image caption for details." path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0006.tif" /></a><div class="fig-orig original-slide"><a section="165496543" class="fig-view-orig at-figureViewLarge" role="button" href="/view-large/figure/165496543/ao4c03987_0006.tif" path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0006.tif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="View large Figure 6.">View Large</a><a section="165496543" href="//acs.silverchair-cdn.com/DownloadFile/DownloadImage.aspx?image=https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/ao4c03987_0006.png?Expires=1791347537&Signature=kvvJkJraFC97xmZEonp6uiBP~39vSzzQdb5TIKLYANVsfzieQ4WswTKc84UTFAuVGqaW0l9r9yrnX-g4dcDxVKFCdAdwUAEV84fTTS30rs0~cmyUNyfVaUmf5eHJYbGQ8pfOfsIidYTgZu6u8inkHiFDmqprXUm8EAtcc82IWsshF7AUo9vmDWgwRYWBc1uJc-kzJFL61sBfFSUZRA5VqJ1EsSyzrm-bpqaWcAL0lonkGbN0HAGRDsOWA3yr80fdxzXf5tCA63YG~ar2DlNg3DcUfZJItOdMtuopUlW~oVTcYkzstv1fN729UwbnRY3tds1sOJ-qj0izEQXTvC17Dw__&Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA&sec=165496543&ar=358560&xsltPath=~/UI/app/XSLT&imagename=&siteId=1000073" class="download-slide stats-download-slide js-download-file-gtm-datalayer-event" role="button" data-filetype="ppt" path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0006.tif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="Download slide for Figure 6.">Download to Slide</a></div></div><div class="graphic-bottom"><div class="label fig-label">Figure 6.</div><div class="caption fig-caption"><p>Pyridine-adsorbed FT-IR spectra of the
CS, ACS, and ANCS catalysts.</p></div></div><a class="close-reveal-modal" href="javascript:;"><i class="icon-general-close" aria-hidden="true"> </i><span class="screenreader-text">Close Figure 6.</span></a></div>
                </div>
                </div>
                <h2 scrollto-destination="165496544" data-legacyid="sec4" id="165496544" data-section-title="4. Catalytic Activity Studies" class="section-title jumplink-heading">4. Catalytic Activity Studies</h2>
                <div  class="">
                </div>
                <h3 scrollto-destination="165496545" data-legacyid="sec4.1" id="165496545" data-section-title="4.1. C–N
Coupling of OPD with Benzylamine
Using Carbon Nanomaterials" class="section-title ">4.1. C–N
Coupling of OPD with Benzylamine
Using Carbon Nanomaterials</h3>
                <div  class="">
                <div id="165496546-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="165496545">
                    
                    <p>The catalytic efficiency of the
developed carbon materials was investigated for the synthesis of 2-phenylbenzimidazole
via cascade C–N coupling of OPD with benzylamine using a 1.5:2.5
molar ratio of OPD and benzylamine in toluene solvent at a 4 h reaction
time and 100 °C reaction temperature under open-air conditions.
In the blank case (i.e., without the catalyst), no noticeable conversion
of OPD was found (entry 1, <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="tbl1" data-open="tbl1" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Table 1</a>). The observed OPD conversion and product selectivity
over the developed carbon nanomaterials (entries 2–4, <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="tbl1" data-open="tbl1" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Table 1</a>) at the same reaction
conditions employed for the blank test indicate their catalytic efficacy
in the C–N condensation reaction under metal-free and open-air
conditions. Pure CS material gave 48% conversion of the OPD, but very
low selectivity to 2-phenylbenzimidazole (36%) was achieved (entry
2, <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="tbl1" data-open="tbl1" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Table 1</a>). In the
case of the ACS catalyst, both the level of conversion of OPD (76%)
and 2-phenylbenzimidazole (82%) was significantly increased (entry
3, <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="tbl1" data-open="tbl1" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Table 1</a>). The best
results were found with the ANCS catalyst, which gave 89% conversion
with 90% 2-phenylbenzimidazole selectivity (entry 4, <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="tbl1" data-open="tbl1" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Table 1</a>). With the increase of reaction
time from 4 to 5 h, the ANCS catalyst gave 96% conversion of OPD and
97% 2-phenylbenzimidazole selectivity (entry 5, <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="tbl2" data-open="tbl2" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Table 2</a>). With 5 and 10 wt % of the ANCS catalyst,
low conversion/selectivity was obtained (entries 6 and 7, <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="tbl1" data-open="tbl1" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Table 1</a>), respectively. Under
the inert atmospheric conditions (i.e., N<sub>2</sub>), the level
of the OPD conversion was very low (entry 8, <a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="tbl1" data-open="tbl1" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Table 1</a>), indicating the necessity of air for the
C–N coupling reaction.</p>
                </div>
                </div>
                <div  class="">
                <div id="165496547-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="165496545">
                    
                    <a id = "165496547" scrollto-destination="165496547"></a><div content-id="tbl1 sec4.1" class="table-wrap table-wide"><div id="tbl1" data-id="tbl1" class="table-wrap-title "><span class="label title-label" id="label-tbl1">Table 1.</span><div class="caption caption-id-" id="caption-tbl1"><div class="title">C–N Coupling
of Benzylamine
and OPD Using Various Carbon-Based Catalysts<a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="t1fn1" data-open="t1fn1" class="link link-ref link-reveal xref-fn js-xref-fn">a</a></div></div> </div><div class="table-overflow"><table role="table" aria-labelledby="&#xA;                        label-tbl1" aria-describedby="&#xA;                        caption-tbl1"><thead><tr><th id="ID0E3" scope="col">s. no.</th><th id="ID0E5" scope="col">catalyst</th><th id="ID0EAB" scope="col">OPD conversion (%)</th><th id="ID0ECB" scope="col">benzimidazole selectivity (%)</th><th id="ID0EEB" scope="col">other products</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td headers="ID0E3">1</td><td headers="ID0E5">blank</td><td headers="ID0EAB">negligible</td><td headers="ID0ECB"> </td><td headers="ID0EEB"> </td></tr><tr><td headers="ID0E3">2</td><td headers="ID0E5">CS</td><td headers="ID0EAB">48</td><td headers="ID0ECB">36</td><td headers="ID0EEB">64</td></tr><tr><td headers="ID0E3">3</td><td headers="ID0E5">ACS</td><td headers="ID0EAB">76</td><td headers="ID0ECB">82</td><td headers="ID0EEB">18</td></tr><tr><td headers="ID0E3">4</td><td headers="ID0E5">ANCS</td><td headers="ID0EAB">89</td><td headers="ID0ECB">90</td><td headers="ID0EEB">10</td></tr><tr><td headers="ID0E3">5<a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="t1fn2" data-open="t1fn2" class="link link-ref link-reveal xref-fn js-xref-fn">b</a></td><td headers="ID0E5">ANCS</td><td headers="ID0EAB">96</td><td headers="ID0ECB">97</td><td headers="ID0EEB">3</td></tr><tr><td headers="ID0E3">6<a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="t1fn3" data-open="t1fn3" class="link link-ref link-reveal xref-fn js-xref-fn">c</a></td><td headers="ID0E5">ANCS</td><td headers="ID0EAB">58</td><td headers="ID0ECB">39</td><td headers="ID0EEB">61</td></tr><tr><td headers="ID0E3">7<a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="t1fn4" data-open="t1fn4" class="link link-ref link-reveal xref-fn js-xref-fn">d</a></td><td headers="ID0E5">ANCS</td><td headers="ID0EAB">82</td><td headers="ID0ECB">81</td><td headers="ID0EEB">19</td></tr><tr><td headers="ID0E3">8<a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="t1fn5" data-open="t1fn5" class="link link-ref link-reveal xref-fn js-xref-fn">e</a></td><td headers="ID0E5">ANCS</td><td headers="ID0EAB">8</td><td headers="ID0ECB">61</td><td headers="ID0EEB">39</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-modal"><table aria-hidden="true"><colgroup><col align="left" /><col align="left" /><col align="left" /><col align="left" /><col align="left" /></colgroup><thead><tr><th>s. no.</th><th>catalyst</th><th>OPD conversion (%)</th><th>benzimidazole selectivity (%)</th><th>other products</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>blank</td><td>negligible</td><td> </td><td> </td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>CS</td><td>48</td><td>36</td><td>64</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>ACS</td><td>76</td><td>82</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>ANCS</td><td>89</td><td>90</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>5<xref rid="t1fn2" ref-type="table-fn">b</xref></td><td>ANCS</td><td>96</td><td>97</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>6<xref rid="t1fn3" ref-type="table-fn">c</xref></td><td>ANCS</td><td>58</td><td>39</td><td>61</td></tr><tr><td>7<xref rid="t1fn4" ref-type="table-fn">d</xref></td><td>ANCS</td><td>82</td><td>81</td><td>19</td></tr><tr><td>8<xref rid="t1fn5" ref-type="table-fn">e</xref></td><td>ANCS</td><td>8</td><td>61</td><td>39</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-wrap-foot"><div class="fn" id="t1fn1" content-id="t1fn1"><span class="label fn-label"><span rel="nofollow" data-fn-id="t1fn1" class="end-note-link">a</span></span><p>1.5 mmol <em>o</em>-phenylenediamine
(OPD), 2.5 mmol benzylamine, 15 wt % catalyst with respect to OPD,
100 °C, 4 h, toluene (1 mL), and open-air conditions.</p></div><div class="fn" id="t1fn2" content-id="t1fn2"><span class="label fn-label"><span rel="nofollow" data-fn-id="t1fn2" class="end-note-link">b</span></span><p>5 h.</p></div><div class="fn" id="t1fn3" content-id="t1fn3"><span class="label fn-label"><span rel="nofollow" data-fn-id="t1fn3" class="end-note-link">c</span></span><p>5 wt % catalyst.</p></div><div class="fn" id="t1fn4" content-id="t1fn4"><span class="label fn-label"><span rel="nofollow" data-fn-id="t1fn4" class="end-note-link">d</span></span><p>10 wt
% catalyst.</p></div><div class="fn" id="t1fn5" content-id="t1fn5"><span class="label fn-label"><span rel="nofollow" data-fn-id="t1fn5" class="end-note-link">e</span></span><p>Inert atmospheric
condition (N<sub>2</sub> gas).</p></div></div><div class="graphic-wrap "><a class="fig-view-orig openInAnotherWindow btn js-view-large" href="/view-large/165496547" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="View large Table 1.">
                  View Large</a></div></div>
                </div>
                </div>
                <div  class="">
                <div id="165496548-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="165496545">
                    
                    <a id = "165496548" scrollto-destination="165496548"></a><div content-id="tbl2 sec4.1" class="table-wrap table-wide"><div id="tbl2" data-id="tbl2" class="table-wrap-title "><span class="label title-label" id="label-tbl2">Table 2.</span><div class="caption caption-id-" id="caption-tbl2"><div class="title">Substrate Scope in the C–N
Coupling of Benzylamine and OPD Using the ANCS Catalyst<a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="t2fn1" data-open="t2fn1" class="link link-ref link-reveal xref-fn js-xref-fn">a</a></div></div> </div><div class="fig-graphic" id="gr8"><a class="jumplink-placeholder" data-sectionId="165496548" data-filename="ao4c03987_0009.tif"><img class="content-image js-graphic-position-float" src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0009.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=y~EKtEauu1XXHiVCDn4bO9aw~CcV84z6BcS9YIpxCDFa11I7LH0bxu570n7jCtX34vXB-gltzU24QmG3qBBuBtaKr-x7QsgHzNrvniGtaMNptRT1tyo2QlC1z2DxfUYWtBqId~pJhBvrw8B6s-AqbjAz39GzmDj10-Yj05VeyWBm1tjoJCq8ceqCcTBrt1lQBLjTN0ECydTwLcp7SYJqL~K~eHN98W2lvZV~fKdLPcPCsBkMo-S4wmdGAxHSsEXSLufG3jG-~FGBMtFoP6hsZZiCz1u~KsShcUCeuUptnzOTLx6xUb0yunTiRe13RhhuXJ5oYq15lZlB8KfE6ef5xA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" data-src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0009.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=y~EKtEauu1XXHiVCDn4bO9aw~CcV84z6BcS9YIpxCDFa11I7LH0bxu570n7jCtX34vXB-gltzU24QmG3qBBuBtaKr-x7QsgHzNrvniGtaMNptRT1tyo2QlC1z2DxfUYWtBqId~pJhBvrw8B6s-AqbjAz39GzmDj10-Yj05VeyWBm1tjoJCq8ceqCcTBrt1lQBLjTN0ECydTwLcp7SYJqL~K~eHN98W2lvZV~fKdLPcPCsBkMo-S4wmdGAxHSsEXSLufG3jG-~FGBMtFoP6hsZZiCz1u~KsShcUCeuUptnzOTLx6xUb0yunTiRe13RhhuXJ5oYq15lZlB8KfE6ef5xA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" alt="Graphic. Refer to the image caption for details." path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0009.tif" /></a></div><div content-id="tbl2" class="table-modal"><img class="content-image js-graphic-position-float" src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0009.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=y~EKtEauu1XXHiVCDn4bO9aw~CcV84z6BcS9YIpxCDFa11I7LH0bxu570n7jCtX34vXB-gltzU24QmG3qBBuBtaKr-x7QsgHzNrvniGtaMNptRT1tyo2QlC1z2DxfUYWtBqId~pJhBvrw8B6s-AqbjAz39GzmDj10-Yj05VeyWBm1tjoJCq8ceqCcTBrt1lQBLjTN0ECydTwLcp7SYJqL~K~eHN98W2lvZV~fKdLPcPCsBkMo-S4wmdGAxHSsEXSLufG3jG-~FGBMtFoP6hsZZiCz1u~KsShcUCeuUptnzOTLx6xUb0yunTiRe13RhhuXJ5oYq15lZlB8KfE6ef5xA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" data-src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0009.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=y~EKtEauu1XXHiVCDn4bO9aw~CcV84z6BcS9YIpxCDFa11I7LH0bxu570n7jCtX34vXB-gltzU24QmG3qBBuBtaKr-x7QsgHzNrvniGtaMNptRT1tyo2QlC1z2DxfUYWtBqId~pJhBvrw8B6s-AqbjAz39GzmDj10-Yj05VeyWBm1tjoJCq8ceqCcTBrt1lQBLjTN0ECydTwLcp7SYJqL~K~eHN98W2lvZV~fKdLPcPCsBkMo-S4wmdGAxHSsEXSLufG3jG-~FGBMtFoP6hsZZiCz1u~KsShcUCeuUptnzOTLx6xUb0yunTiRe13RhhuXJ5oYq15lZlB8KfE6ef5xA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" alt="Graphic. Refer to the image caption for details." path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0009.tif" /></div><div class="table-wrap-foot"><div class="fn" id="t2fn1" content-id="t2fn1"><span class="label fn-label"><span rel="nofollow" data-fn-id="t2fn1" class="end-note-link">a</span></span><p>1.5 mmol OPD, 2.5 mmol benzylamine,
15 wt % catalyst with respect to OPD, 100 °C, 5 h, toluene (1
mL), and open-air conditions.</p></div><div class="fn" id="t2fn2" content-id="t2fn2"><span class="label fn-label"><span rel="nofollow" data-fn-id="t2fn2" class="end-note-link">b</span></span><p>OPD conversion.</p></div><div class="fn" id="t2fn3" content-id="t2fn3"><span class="label fn-label"><span rel="nofollow" data-fn-id="t2fn3" class="end-note-link">c</span></span><p>Benzimidazole
selectivity.</p></div></div><div class="graphic-wrap "><a class="fig-view-orig openInAnotherWindow btn js-view-large" href="/view-large/165496548" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="View large Table 2.">
                  View Large</a></div></div>
                </div>
                </div>
                <h3 scrollto-destination="165496549" data-legacyid="sec4.2" id="165496549" data-section-title="4.2. Kinetic and Hot-Filtration Studies in the
C–N Coupling of Benzylamine and OPD Using the ANCS Catalyst" class="section-title ">4.2. Kinetic and Hot-Filtration Studies in the
C–N Coupling of Benzylamine and OPD Using the ANCS Catalyst</h3>
                <div  class="">
                <div id="165496550-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="165496549">
                    
                    <p>The effect of reaction temperature from 1 to 5 h in the coupling
of benzylamine and OPD using the ANCS catalyst was conducted at 100
°C in toluene solvent (<a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="fig7" data-open="fig7" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Figure 7</a>a). Both the conversion of OPD and product selectivity
were rapidly increased with the increase of reaction time up to 3
h. This is due to the availability of high concentrations of reactants
until 3 h, accelerating the forward reaction toward benzimidazole
formation. After 3 h of reaction time, the reaction faces equilibrium
limitations, resulting in a trivial increase in OPD conversion. The
maximum conversion of OPD (96%) with 97% selectivity to benzimidazole
was obtained at 5 h. The hot-filtration test was performed to elucidate
the stability of the ANCS catalyst in the C–N condensation
of the OPD and benzylamine (<a href="javascript:;" reveal-id="fig7" data-open="fig7" class="link link-reveal link-table xref-fig">Figure 7</a>b). Initially, the reaction was conducted for 2 h,
and then the ANCS catalyst was removed from the reaction mixture by
centrifugation. The reaction was continued for another 3 h using the
obtained catalyst-free filtrate at the same reaction conditions. The
conversion of OPD remains the same almost after removing the catalyst.
Hence, the leaching of the active sites has not occurred, and the
reaction is truly heterogeneous, emphasizing the stability of the
ANCS catalyst.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="165496551-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="165496549">
                    
                    <a id = "165496551" scrollto-destination="165496551"></a><div data-id="fig7" class="fig fig-section" reveal-group-id="sec4.2"><span class="hidden" id="viewTranscriptId_"></span><div class="fig-label fig-label">Figure 7</div><div class="graphic-wrap"><a class="fig-link" href="/view-large/figure/165496551/ao4c03987_0007.tif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-describedby="sr-fig-viewer-action"><img class="content-image js-graphic-position-float" src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0007.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=nisev8U4eMicoKe20WBw58WbwjPjWd0U52nMZPWA6kJInx5ry4M0qSh6ZvAg9kMFeNz8E4q-LUClBu9wgCaJYIdxIASD3QsApOtUS-ONXnaPSoRbp7-kBHoJ9F4V08m3PVJgWd2vk1oclG33BhItYyWSL7eJTByuS86F7NNEkHF5B5BTE5L~fqY2~hOoXCx2T7Cru5~aCfAW0iVy-oVPNL~rxQgDh8dcdVs6NTYtmMaqJU9gCZozzEPm648K1OTjlaaSP0zF5fEl~5CoR~Gneek6LsPwIu~Zz1tuoRdw798kvK78XCWjpJpUtbNtFIpBwwgv7w~2SPDMs2xjWhXUUw__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" data-src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0007.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=nisev8U4eMicoKe20WBw58WbwjPjWd0U52nMZPWA6kJInx5ry4M0qSh6ZvAg9kMFeNz8E4q-LUClBu9wgCaJYIdxIASD3QsApOtUS-ONXnaPSoRbp7-kBHoJ9F4V08m3PVJgWd2vk1oclG33BhItYyWSL7eJTByuS86F7NNEkHF5B5BTE5L~fqY2~hOoXCx2T7Cru5~aCfAW0iVy-oVPNL~rxQgDh8dcdVs6NTYtmMaqJU9gCZozzEPm648K1OTjlaaSP0zF5fEl~5CoR~Gneek6LsPwIu~Zz1tuoRdw798kvK78XCWjpJpUtbNtFIpBwwgv7w~2SPDMs2xjWhXUUw__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" alt="Figure 7. Refer to the image caption for details." path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0007.tif" /></a><div class="fig-orig original-slide"><a section="165496551" class="fig-view-orig at-figureViewLarge" role="button" href="/view-large/figure/165496551/ao4c03987_0007.tif" path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0007.tif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="View large Figure 7.">View Large</a><a section="165496551" href="//acs.silverchair-cdn.com/DownloadFi