of coupling of benzylamine with an OPD
to form benzimidazole over the ANCS catalyst.</p></div></div></div><div id="fig8" content-id="fig8" class="fig fig-modal reveal-modal" data-reveal="data-reveal"><div class="fig-label fig-label">Figure 8</div><div class="graphic-wrap"><a class="fig-link" href="/view-large/figure/165496558/ao4c03987_0008.tif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-describedby="sr-fig-viewer-action"><img class="content-image js-graphic-position-float" src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0008.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=fRs6dKESSHubPZV1nzJ8nd3tJyFTtCNk4Oj66rqpPX-X~cWajdMg-srIf8CiK4dobaDVDYKaAQnMYcA5JDzkjJQH~P6RkxZTxuZQr6E3Nj5QA76iPONSlZ~ntJBnD6uC2GZos94jPX7FJHk-vClpcfADlgo9ZwyRCYzKIoR4IGbVsc-DgdAO~JhPsmrfgyYBrz7vpgqnMFHG0fbfkCgtXMQTf5XWqE~MV0ssii7wFqliWbfkqjz56JDABt2Nw7zKJSBT2GJlM43G~ZDY5P-KEzy2FZnSWtFzOA4xvILpf4AhoVuUFGjtnhXhuw4QKmtDmTqpaTngbMMq7epW0J6u1A__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" data-src="https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/m_ao4c03987_0008.png?Expires=1791347537&amp;Signature=fRs6dKESSHubPZV1nzJ8nd3tJyFTtCNk4Oj66rqpPX-X~cWajdMg-srIf8CiK4dobaDVDYKaAQnMYcA5JDzkjJQH~P6RkxZTxuZQr6E3Nj5QA76iPONSlZ~ntJBnD6uC2GZos94jPX7FJHk-vClpcfADlgo9ZwyRCYzKIoR4IGbVsc-DgdAO~JhPsmrfgyYBrz7vpgqnMFHG0fbfkCgtXMQTf5XWqE~MV0ssii7wFqliWbfkqjz56JDABt2Nw7zKJSBT2GJlM43G~ZDY5P-KEzy2FZnSWtFzOA4xvILpf4AhoVuUFGjtnhXhuw4QKmtDmTqpaTngbMMq7epW0J6u1A__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA" alt="Figure 8. Refer to the image caption for details." path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0008.tif" /></a><div class="fig-orig original-slide"><a section="165496558" class="fig-view-orig at-figureViewLarge" role="button" href="/view-large/figure/165496558/ao4c03987_0008.tif" path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0008.tif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="View large Figure 8.">View Large</a><a section="165496558" href="//acs.silverchair-cdn.com/DownloadFile/DownloadImage.aspx?image=https://acs.silverchair-cdn.com/acs/content_public/journal/acsodf/9/33/10.1021_acsomega.4c03987/3/ao4c03987_0008.png?Expires=1791347537&Signature=EMX51WxDX5zhY67KH03hGG8UjmEsWQoaCUDAmYy68GNOZZXpvvPLXL2S69NOVnCmXeyTg2gEiLqhpr0j8OZsJnfteOh-YtITqBXshh2qdqd3i-sMf0vi1H8R1-e~R4sg5mKXnG8gh1nCCvU~fyBqeWB6c9fu41oDb-i2clO3Yy3VPjAdaOROHZ6N68dyd-qrq7mZym3aXomTJwK3ylT8OebkHOsQ4bH-278f1Cjaq8epvUAHbSUQd-FojdfJosL4LPJk~~xOLE5OgrraUOjdWwMRF5gCFmY~ctjmWSk4mk-cMlhvRBVtTsA-A9S71lOh79-SdAJchet62memxlzgpw__&Key-Pair-Id=APKAIE5G5CRDK6RD3PGA&sec=165496558&ar=358560&xsltPath=~/UI/app/XSLT&imagename=&siteId=1000073" class="download-slide stats-download-slide js-download-file-gtm-datalayer-event" role="button" data-filetype="ppt" path-from-xml="ao4c03987_0008.tif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" aria-label="Download slide for Figure 8.">Download to Slide</a></div></div><div class="graphic-bottom"><div class="label fig-label">Figure 8.</div><div class="caption fig-caption"><p>Schematic representation
