                    <p>The Supporting Information is
available free of charge at <a class="link" href="https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acsomega.4c03987?goto=supporting-info" target="_blank">https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acsomega.4c03987</a>.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="165496563-content" class="article-section-wrapper js-article-section js-content-section  " data-section-parent-id="165496561">
                    
                    <ul class="list-simple"><li><p>Experimental section;
N<sub>2</sub> adsorption–desorption
isotherms; BET surface area, pore volume, and pore diameter; EPR spectra;
the probable reaction mechanism for homocoupling of benzylamine; and
the comparison of the activity of the ANCS catalyst with that of the
literature reports for the C–N coupling of OPD with benzylamine
(<a class="supplementary-material-link" reveal-id="all-supplement-materials-popup" data-open="all-supplement-materials-popup" href="/acsodf/article-supplement/358560/pdf/ao4c03987_si_001/" path-from-xml="sifile1">PDF</a>)</p></li></ul>
                </div>
                </div>
